```csharp
// =============================================================================
// PER-SECTION PAGE SETUP
// =============================================================================
// Each section independently controls its own:
//   - PageSize (portrait vs landscape, paper size)
//   - PageMargin
//   - Columns
//   - Headers/Footers
//   - PageNumberType (restart numbering)
//   - LineNumbering
